        tex: "\\alpha + \\delta = 180^\\circ \\qquad \\beta + \\gamma = 180^\\circ \\qquad \\begin{gathered} \\text{równoramienny:} \\\\ \\alpha = \\beta,\\; \\gamma = \\delta \\end{gathered}",
