        tex: "\\begin{gathered} \\text{jeden kąt} = \\\\ \\frac{(n - 2) \\cdot 180^\\circ}{n} \\end{gathered} \\qquad \\begin{array}{rl} n = 3: & 60^\\circ \\\\ n = 4: & 90^\\circ \\\\ n = 5: & 108^\\circ \\\\ n = 6: & 120^\\circ \\\\ n = 8: & 135^\\circ \\end{array}",
